      "en": "The **CEFR** (Common European Framework of Reference) describes levels A1 to C2 with a **can-do statement** («I can…»). C2 is not «like a native speaker» — it is **proficiency**: you understand virtually everything with ease and express yourself fluently and precisely, distinguishing fine shades of meaning in complex situations."
